		{
			dependencies: ["49001B4F8FF6A5D9"]
			description: [
				"Becoming a powerful mage is not about staying at home and studying endlessly, it is about traveling across the world in search of traces of magic. This means you may need a reliable means of transportation to make your journey easier."
				""
				"The brooms from the &2Hexerei&r mod is a great option. It not only allows you to fly for travel, but also supports extensive customization. Equipping different types of backpacks, replacing broom heads, or adding decorations can greatly enhance your travel experience."
				""
				"Of course, if you find it too complex, you can also craft a more affordable &6“Majo’s Broom”&r instead."
