		{
			description: [
				"The &dIron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks&r mod is a magic mod inspired by classic RPG games, designed to bring traditional spellcasting mechanics into Minecraft."
				""
				"You can obtain magical power by fighting dangerous wizards, raiding various naturally generated structures, delving into dungeons, collecting resources, and discovering powerful magical artifacts."
				""
				"The magic in &dIron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks&r focuses more on &6tangible, spell-based abilities&r that can be directly observed and used in combat."
				""
				"At the same time, &conly magical attacks from Iron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks are recognized as magical damage within this modpack&r, which is highly important for defeating certain bosses later on."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1b
				id: "patchouli:guide_book"
				tag: {
					"patchouli:book": "irons_spellbooks:iss_guide_book"
				}
			}
			id: "49001B4F8FF6A5D9"
			rewards: [{
