			description: [
				"{image:kubejs:textures/task/isb_3.png width:160 height:120 align:1}"
				""
				"1: Place &6Ink&r, the quality of the ink determines the quality of the scroll."
				""
				"2: Place &6Paper&r, each scroll requires one sheet of paper to write."
				""
				"3: Place the &2school specific material&r, this determines the spell school of the scroll."
				"After placing the required school material, available spells will be displayed. Some spells may appear as question marks. Try using higher tier ink to reveal and write them."
				""
				"4: The completed scroll will appear here. Note that materials are only consumed when you &eleft-click&r to take the scroll."
			]
